# One line-ending policy for the whole repository: text files
# are normalized to LF on commit and checked out as LF.
#
# Why this exists: the repo previously had no .gitattributes,
# so a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true rewrote every
# text file and produced a whole-file diff of 13,499 insertions
# against 13,499 deletions with zero real changes (recorded in
# HANDOFF.md, "Environment notes"). One policy here means the
# worktree never disagrees with the index about line endings.
* text=auto eol=lf